      "message": "I actually meant that `tcpci_emul_disconnect_partner` should call `tccpi_emul_set_vbus_level(tcpci_emul, VBUS_REMOVED)`, but adding the charger call here is probably a good idea too. `tcpci_emul_connect_partner` should probably also set VBUS to present.",
