      "writtenOn": "2023-06-26T16:23:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "tcpci_emul_disconnect_partner sets to VBUS_SAFE0V here: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4637715/4/zephyr/emul/tcpc/emul_tcpci.c#682, I\u0027ll change that to VBUS_REMOVED.\n\n\nI added VBUS_PRESENT to tcpci_emul_connect_partner.",
